OL,3,GNEWSA'Heartbreaking': The man driven
OL,4,Aout by the UK's #5bn theme park
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrounded by rolling fields and lakes,
OL,7,FRitchie Wood's home of 11 years
OL,8,Fprovided the serene village life he
OL,9,Floved.
OL,11,FYet in recent weeks, his neighbours
OL,12,Fhave packed their bags and left - their
OL,13,Fhouses in Kempston Hardwick,
OL,14,FBedfordshire, soon to be reduced to
OL,15,Frubble.
OL,17,F"It's totally changed to how it used to
OL,18,Fbe - it used to be lovely. We had a
OL,19,Fnice little community here, lots of
OL,20,Fwildlife, very quiet," Wood tells the
OL,21,FBBC.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
